<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CyberCafé | Café & Tecnologia</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #0f172a;
            color: #f8fafc;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px 8%;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
            border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #38bdf8;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        nav a {
            color: #94a3b8;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 20px;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        .hero {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 100px 20px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%);
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #f8fafc;
        }

        .hero span {
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        .hero p {
            max-width: 600px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .btn {
            background-color: #38bdf8;
            color: #0f172a;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: transform 0.2s, background-color 0.3s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #7dd3fc;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .menu-section {
            padding: 60px 8%;
        }

        .menu-section h2 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            color: #f8fafc;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: #1e293b;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: #38bdf8;
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #38bdf8;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .card p {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .price {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #f8fafc;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid #1e293b;
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <a href="#" class="logo">⚡ CyberCafé</a>
        <nav>
            <a href="#inicio">Início</a>
            <a href="#menu">Cardápio</a>
            <a href="#contato">Contato</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section id="inicio" class="hero">
            <h1>O café do futuro, <span>hoje</span>.</h1>
            <p>Combinações de grãos especiais, ambiente climatizado com Wi-Fi ultrarrápido e estações de trabalho para desenvolvedores e criadores.</p>
            <a href="#menu" class="btn">Ver Cardápio</a>
        </section>

        <section id="menu" class="menu-section">
            <h2>Especiais do Dia</h2>
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Espresso 404</h3>
                    <p>Shot duplo de arábica para quando seu código não compila de primeira.</p>
                    <span class="price">R$ 9,00</span>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Latte Algoritmo</h3>
                    <p>Café cremoso com leite vaporizado e toque de baunilha artesanal.</p>
                    <span class="price">R$ 14,00</span>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Cold Brew Cyber</h3>
                    <p>Extraído a frio por 18 horas, leve, refrescante e ultra cafeinado.</p>
                    <span class="price">R$ 16,00</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer id="contato">
        <p>&copy; 2026 CyberCafé Neon. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
<!-- Conexão com o script JavaScript -->
    <script src="script.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>